@step Start the configured runtime and verify readiness.
aeat --format json app runtime start
@expect result.listener == "ready"
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Enable startup at OS login.
@static aeat app runtime enable
@blocked unconverted Provisions real per-user native manager configuration; execution and reproducibility require an owned native manager facility, which this page's fixture does not provide.
@step Disable login startup and retain on-demand configuration.
@static aeat app runtime disable
@blocked unconverted Changes real per-user native manager configuration; execution and reproducibility require an owned native manager facility, which this page's fixture does not provide.
@step Request stopping the owner shared by all profiles and work.
@result aeat --format json app runtime stop --acknowledge-all-profiles-and-work
@expect error.context.reason == "runtime_unavailable"
@expect exit_code == 2
